<title>GERMANY: Veba details 1996 results.</title>
<headline>Veba details 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   2,634   vs   2,107</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     4,435   vs   3,836</p>
<p>    Group profit net of minorities	 2,458   vs   1,915</p>
<p>    Dividend (proposed)			1.90    vs   1.70 marks</p>
<p>    Earnings per share			 5.04    vs   4.33 marks</p>
<p>    Group sales				 74,541   vs  72,372</p>
<p>    Earnings by DVFA method		  2,491   vs   2,113</p>
<p>    Earnings per share by DVFA method    5.04    vs  4.33  marks</p>
<p>    Interest income				382   vs     374</p>
<p>    Workforce (Dec 31)		     122,110   vs 125,158</p>
<p>    Cash flow (DVFA)			   8,538   vs   8,570</p>
<p>    Investments				  8,783   vs   9,722</p>
<p>    Consolidated group earnings		938   vs     830</p>
<p>    Net Return on Equity		     13.3    vs  11.4 pct</p>
<p>    Earnings (DVFA)			    2,491   vs   2,113</p>
<p>    Parent income from ord. act.	   2,234   vs   2,090</p>
<p>    Parent net profit			  1,720   vs   1,343</p>
<p>    Parent dividend (proposed)	     1.90    vs   1.70 marks</p>
<p>    Additions to reserves			782   vs     513</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German diversified energy, chemicals and services group is Veba AG. Figures in brackets denote a loss.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
</text>
